<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 386 FOR FIVE AT TEA IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 386 FOR FIVE AT TEA IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 386 for five wickets at tea on the fifth and final day of the first test against Pakistan on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: First innings - Sri Lanka 330, Pakistan 378.</p>
